      538        B-add AT ROW 10.25 COL 1
      539        B-chg AT ROW 10.25 COL 11
      540        B-del AT ROW 10.25 COL 21
      541        SPACE(68.24) SKIP(0.24)
      542       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      543            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      544            TITLE "Налоги"
      545            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      546   ASSIGN
      547          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      548          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      549   ON GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      550   DO:
      551     run check-sums in this-procedure no-error.
      552     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
      553     run proc-save in this-procedure no-error.
      554     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
      555   END.
